WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.740
Would you take ₹1 that
doubles every day for 30 days?

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:05.770
Day 1: ₹1.

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:08.100
Day 2: ₹2.

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:09.770
Day 3: ₹4.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:12.800
Day 10: Just ₹512.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:14.430
Sounds pretty disappointing, right?

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:15.070
But wait.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:17.680
Day 20: More than ₹5 lakh.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.090
Day 25: More than ₹1.6 crore.

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:22.220
And on Day 30?

00:00:22.575 --> 00:00:24.170
₹53.7 CRORE!

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:26.120
That's the power of exponential growth.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:30.310
Something that starts incredibly small can
become unbelievably large when it keeps

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:30.880
doubling.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:34.370
Would you take ₹53.7 crore on Day 30,

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:37.250
or would you still choose a
guaranteed ₹1 crore today?

